{"version":1,"content":"<p>前AV女優濱崎真緒前日凌晨在尖沙咀「私竇」疑遭落藥，送入ICU後體內驗出對4種毒品呈陽性反應。</p><p>濱崎昨日出院，因執法部門指示不能接受訪問，她面對傳媒時只以「OK」及「多謝」作回應，隨即趕往落口供。</p><p>事件愈鬧愈大，不但港人震驚，連日本傳媒也廣泛報</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:21:40.054861+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T16:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T16:18:18.704153+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T16:18:18.704153+00:00","content_hash":"22b3f0a077e2a55b87ba9d5ef7927b1ac97a970d15c39f02d0f490cd8f8076ba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}